                      │
          ┌───────────┴───────────┐
          ↓                       ↓
   secretKeyRef               volumes
          ↓                       ↓
 Environment Variable       volumeMounts
          ↓                       ↓
DB_PASSWORD=MyPassword123  /etc/app-secret/
                                  ↓
